# Atomic Dream Labs

> **Offline-first Artificial Intelligence, Theoretical Physics, and High-Performance Systems Architecture.**

Atomic Dream Labs is an independent, clean-room research and software development laboratory based in Greenup, Kentucky. Founded and led by **William Brian Ware**, the lab designs deterministic, local AI models, explores scalar field modifications to gravity, and builds high-performance custom engine frameworks.

---

## 🛠️ Core Research & Development Focus

### 🧠 1. Sovereign AI & Local Architectures
* **Sovereign Epistemic Evolution Model (SEEM):** An offline-first, highly deterministic local AI architecture engineered for privacy, zero cloud dependency, and long-term state persistence.
* **Vector Symbolic Architecture (VSA):** A hyperdimensional computing core providing continuous symbolic reasoning, dynamic memory loops, and ultra-low-latency pattern matching directly on local hardware.

### 🌌 2. Theoretical Physics & Cosmology
* **Coherence Field Theory (CFT):** A modified gravity framework examining scalar field dynamics and non-local gravitational interactions to explain galactic rotation curves without relying on dark matter hypotheses.
* **Informational Quantum Gravity (IQG) & The Ware Constant:** Physics modeling linking thermodynamic information entropy with spacetime geometry, utilizing the Ware Constant ($W \approx 0.08$) within Modified Newtonian Dynamics (MOND) and SPARC dataset analyses.

### ⚙️ 3. Systems Triage & Security Frameworks
* **JKillnHide (formerly Omega Defense):** A low-level PowerShell process-monitoring and system telemetry inspection tool designed for deep diagnostics, native Windows Management Instrumentation (WMI) monitoring, and stealth system health triage.

### 🎮 4. Engine Architecture & Game Development
* **Project Cold Boot:** An action-puzzle reality-editing title built in Godot 4.x leveraging C++ GDExtension integration.
* **DLRSE & AC-3 Solvers:** Custom graph simulation kernels and constraint solvers engineered to drive real-time graph transformations and dual-reality shaders.

### ⛓️ 5. Decentralized Systems
* **BlockSwarm Framework:** A suite of Solidity smart contracts designed for decentralized autonomous organization (DAO) governance, state validation, and cryptographic Merkle proof verification.

